<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's Ashaka Cement half-year profits steady.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's Ashaka Cement half-year profits steady.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year result for Nigeria's Ashaka Cement to end-May. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				    1996	     1995</p>
<p> Turnover			1,700    vs   1,500</p>
<p> Profit before taxation	370    vs     341</p>
<p> Taxation			  122.6  vs     109.3</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	 247.4  vs     231.7</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
